|champion     = Jinx
|skill        = Q
|icon         = false
|blurb        = {{sbc|Toggle:}} {{ci|Jinx}} switches between Pow-Pow, her minigun, and Fishbones, her rocket launcher.
|blurb2       = {{sbc|{{cci|Pow-Pow.png|Jinx#Pow-Pow|Pow-Pow}}:}} {{tip|Basic attacks}} with '''Pow-Pow''' generate {{tip|stacks}} of [[File:Rev'd up buff.png|20px]] ''Rev'd up'' for a short time. Stacks expire one at a time.
|blurb3       = {{sbc|{{cci|Fishbones.png|Jinx#Fishbones|Fishbones}}:}} Basic attacks with '''Fishbones''' {{sti|mana|{{as|cost mana}}}} to deal {{as|increased physical damage}} to the primary target as well as surrounding enemies. While using '''Fishbones''', ''Jinx'' gains {{sti|range|'''bonus''' range}} but loses a portion of her {{sti|as|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}}.
|blurb4       = {{sbc|Rev'd up:}} For each stack, '''Jinx''' gains {{sti|as|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}}, with the first stack being twice as potent. Only the first attack after switching to '''Fishbones''' will benefit from ''Rev'd up''.
|description  = {{sbc|Toggle:}} '''Jinx''' switches between ''{{cci|Pow-Pow.png|Jinx#Pow-Pow|Pow-Pow}}'', her minigun, and ''{{cci|Fishbones.png|Jinx#Fishbones|Fishbones}}'', her rocket launcher.
|icon2         = Pow-Pow.png
|description2  = {{sbc|Pow-Pow:}} {{tip|Basic attacks}} with ''Pow-Pow'' generate a {{tip|stack}} of [[File:Rev'd up buff.png|20px]] ''Rev'd up'' for {{fd|2.5}} seconds, refreshing on subsequent attacks with ''Pow-Pow'' and stacking up to 3 times. Each stack of ''Rev'd up'' grants {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}}, with all stacks beyond the first one being 50% effective. Stacks expire one by one when the duration ends.
|leveling2     = {{st|Bonus Attack Speed|{{ap|30/2 to 130/2}}%|Attack Speed per Subsequent Stack|{{ap|30/4 to 130/4}}%|Maximum Attack Speed|{{ap|30 to 130}}%}}
|icon3        = Switcheroo!.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Fishbones:}} Basic attacks with ''Fishbones'' cost {{sti|{{as|mana}}}} {{tip|on-attack}} to deal {{as|110% AD}} {{as|'''modified''' physical damage}} to the target and nearby enemies. The damage is affected by {{tip|critical strike}} modifiers. While ''Fishbones'' is equipped, '''Jinx''' gains {{sti|range|'''bonus''' range}} but loses {{sti|{{as|10% of her '''bonus''' attack speed}}}}.
|leveling3    = {{st|Bonus Range|{{ap|100 to 200}}}}
|description4 = ''Only the first attack after switching to [[File:Switcheroo!.png|20px|link=]] Fishbones will benefit from [[File:Rev'd up buff.png|20px]] Rev'd up''.
|static       = {{fd|0.9}}
|cost         = 20
|costtype     = Mana per attack with {{ai|Switcheroo!|Jinx|Fishbones}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly=true}} {{tt|250|Rocket splash radius}}
|cast time    = none
|targeting    = Auto
|affects      = Self
|damagetype   = Physical
|spellshield  = False
|spelleffects = special
|projectile   = 
|onhiteffects = 
|parry = true
|grounded     = 
|knockdown    = 
|notes        = 
* Toggle abilities do not count as ability activations for the purposes of on-cast effects such as {{tip|Spellblade}} and triggering {{ais|Force Pulse|Kassadin}} passive.
* Despite '''Jinx''' starting the game using {{ai|Pow-Pow|Jinx|''Pow-Pow''}} she doesn't receive any bonus attack speed until ''Switcheroo!'' has been learned.
* {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} splash damage affects structures (minions will target '''Jinx''') but does not affect targets if '''Jinx's''' attacks are {{tip|block|blocked}}, {{tip|dodge|dodged}}, or {{tip|blind|missed}}.
* {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} {{nie|Wind's Fury}} bolts are special-cased to generate one {{ai|Pow-Pow|Jinx|''Pow-Pow''|nolink=true}} stack per enemy hit.
* Each of {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} additional bolts apply {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|Fishbones'}} splash damage, which stacks with each other.
* Both weapons deal {{tip|basic damage}} to their primary target (this includes the increased damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}}), which applies {{sti|life steal}} based on the damage dealt (post-mitigation) as usual.
* The splash damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} is based on the pre-mitigation damage done to the primary target (which includes critical strikes), and is not considered {{as|'''modified''' physical damage}}. It deals {{tip|default damage}} and thus doesn't apply {{sti|life steal}} or {{tip|on-hit}} effects.
** Similarly, the splash damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} will not apply the additional damage from {{iis|Hexoptics C44}} {{sbc|Magnification}}.
* {{ais|Fishbones|Jinx}} damage calculations:
** Basic attack damage: {{tt|{{as|{{#expr:100*1.1}}% AD}}|100%{{times}}1.1}}
** Critical strike damage: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*2}}}}% AD}}|110%{{times}}2}}
** Critical strike damage with {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*(2+0.3)}}}}% AD}}|110%{{times}}(2+0.3)}}
** {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} bolt damage: {{tt|{{as|{{#expr:100*1.1*0.55}}% AD}}|55%{{times}}1.1}}
** Bolt critical strike damage: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*0.55*2}}}}% AD}}|60.5%{{times}}2}}
** Bolt critical strike damage with {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*0.55*(2+0.3)}}}}% AD}}|60.5%{{times}}2.3}}
** Maximum potential damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1+100*1.1*0.55*2}}}}% AD}}|110% + 60.5%{{times}}2}}
** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*2+100*1.1*2*0.55*2}}}}% AD}}|(110% + 60.5%{{times}}2){{times}}2}}
** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}} and {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*(2+0.3)+100*1.1*(2+0.3)*0.55*2}}}}% AD}}|(110% + 60.5%{{times}}2){{times}}2.3}}
|yvideo       = z3WLIiX5PFE
}}

